ow ideas evolved over time to find old solutions for new problems and avoid repeating past failures (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/research/tracing-knowledge-lineages/SKILL.md)\n- Using Git Worktrees: Create isolated git worktrees with smart directory selection and safety verification (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/collaboration/using-git-worktrees/SKILL.md)\n- Verification Before Completion: Run verification commands and confirm output before claiming success (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/debugging/verification-before-completion/SKILL.md)\n- When Stuck - Problem-Solving Dispatch: Dispatch to the right problem-solving technique based on how you're stuck (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/problem-solving/when-stuck/SKILL.md)\n- Writing Plans: Create detailed implementation plans with bite-sized tasks for engineers with zero codebase context (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/collaboration/writing-plans/SKILL.md)\n- Writing Skills: TDD for process documentation - test with subagents before writing, iterate until bulletproof (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/superpowers-skills/skills/meta/writing-skills/SKILL.md)\n- pr: Create a pull request for the current branch. Discovers the project's build/lint/test setup from Makefile, mise, CI config, or README and runs full verification before pushing. Automatically fixes any verification failures and prompts the user to commit before proceeding. Accepts an optional base branch (defaults to main). Use when the user says \"create pr\", \"open pr\", \"make pr\", or \"/pr\". (file: /Users/pfleidi/.agents/skills/pr/SKILL.md)\n- pr-feedback: Fetch PR review comments, separate human from bot feedback, and address them differently. Human comments are addressed one at a time with user approval. Bot comments are batched and fixed in one pass. No commits are made — code changes only, user commits on their own terms. Accepts a